# Witness: an area-verdict table declaring one area twice

Every one of the eight is declared, and nothing outside the eight appears, so neither of the
other two halves of this clause fires. An area with two verdict rows can carry two different
verdicts, which is why the duplicate is reported rather than tolerated.

